# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# OneDesk CRM
#
# Two things must never reach this repository: the keys and passwords that let
# somebody in, and the customers' own data. Both live in folders the server
# creates at runtime, listed below. If you add a new one, add it here first.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Dependencies and build output
node_modules/
dist/
dist-server/
*.tsbuildinfo

# Settings and keys. .env.local holds the AI key and the Excel path; it is
# deliberately not VITE_-prefixed so it never reaches the browser bundle.
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
.env.production
.env.staging
# .env.example is tracked on purpose: it documents the settings, with no values.

# The accounts: password hashes, the session signing secret, and the list of
# starting passwords. Real people's credentials — never committed.
.crm-auth/

# The CRM itself: every customer, invoice, ageing row and follow-up.
.crm-data/

# Weekly KPI saved days and scores, which are the same customer data.
.crm-snapshots/

# Alert settings, which carry the recipients' email addresses.
.crm-alerts.json

# Anything anyone marks as local, as a backstop for the two rules above.
*.local.json
!*.example.json

# The workbook, if it is ever copied into the project folder.
*.xlsx
*.xlsm
*.xls

# Logs and coverage
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
coverage/
.cache/

# Editors and operating systems
.vscode/
.idea/
*.suo
*.ntvs*
*.njsproj
*.sln
*.sw?
*.swp
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
